1
00:00:00,520 --> 00:00:07,602
CleanAirSchool turns hourly PM2.5 readings into a recess decision a school nurse can act on in thirty seconds.

2
00:00:07,772 --> 00:00:14,878
The EPA 2024 air quality band sits above the fold, with outdoor air marked against the modeled indoor result.

3
00:00:15,049 --> 00:00:18,629
One click runs the wildfire classroom intervention demo.

4
00:00:19,249 --> 00:00:24,832
A smoke plume builds across twelve hours, and the NowCast engine weights the newest readings most.

5
00:00:25,002 --> 00:00:33,730
Outdoor air lands at AQI 167, Unhealthy, while one Corsi Rosenthal box holds the modeled classroom near AQI 30.

6
00:00:33,900 --> 00:00:44,457
Four cards report the outdoor reading, the indoor steady state, delivered clean air changes, and fresh air flow per person against the ASHRAE 241 target.

7
00:00:45,077 --> 00:00:51,521
The operations panel turns that number into decisions for recess, outdoor athletics, and asthma care.

8
00:00:51,691 --> 00:00:56,184
Parent and staff notices print in English and Spanish, side by side.

9
00:00:56,803 --> 00:01:03,366
Four scenarios cover the school day, from a bus drop off corridor spike to a gym hosting relocated PE.

10
00:01:03,537 --> 00:01:09,969
Each preset reloads the room, the hourly series, and the cleaner stock, then every number recomputes.

11
00:01:10,589 --> 00:01:17,337
The calculator prices real choices, a MERV upgrade, filter age, and up to twelve portable units.

12
00:01:17,507 --> 00:01:22,474
Real world derates discount each extra unit and model a loaded filter at end of life.

13
00:01:23,094 --> 00:01:27,346
The decay chart models two hours of classroom air with and without cleaners.

14
00:01:27,516 --> 00:01:32,937
A pointer sweep reads every ten minute mark, and the same range slider works from the keyboard.

15
00:01:33,557 --> 00:01:41,702
Bars compare delivered CADR and three year cost for a ninety dollar Corsi box, a classroom HEPA tower, and a commercial scrubber.

16
00:01:41,872 --> 00:01:47,378
The budget panel equips twenty modeled classrooms and totals hardware plus filter replacements.

17
00:01:47,998 --> 00:01:52,892
Verify EPA 2024 runs the breakpoint benchmark right in the page.

18
00:01:53,062 --> 00:01:58,697
Thirteen of thirteen exact edge checks pass across all six federal tiers plus Beyond Index.

19
00:01:59,317 --> 00:02:04,440
The fleet lab prices a whole school, five strategies across four smoke regimes.

20
00:02:04,609 --> 00:02:11,934
A Pareto chart maps cost against delivered clean air, and every export carries a SHA 256 digest.

21
00:02:12,104 --> 00:02:15,578
The tamper check shows a single changed dollar getting caught.

22
00:02:16,198 --> 00:02:23,712
Twenty four in page self tests pass, and behind them four hundred eighteen Node tests plus thirteen eval checks guard the same math.

23
00:02:23,882 --> 00:02:29,013
Every figure on screen is a labeled engineering projection, not a measured school pilot.

24
00:02:29,633 --> 00:02:36,019
CleanAirSchool. Wildfire smoke outside, clean air inside, and the answer in thirty seconds.
